# The NDI SDK payload is large (~30 MB/platform) and carries the NDI SDK licence, so it is NOT
# committed by default — populate it with scripts/fetch_ndi_sdk.sh (see README.md).
# If the team decides on a self-contained checkout, remove these ignores and track the payload
# via Git LFS instead (and get NDI redistribution sign-off first).
*/include/
*/lib/
# Keep this dir and its docs tracked.
!README.md
!.gitignore
